# Static analysis (ADR 0045 · ENG-61). Warnings only: run with `clang-tidy -p build/<preset>`.
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: 'engine/(include|src)/.*'
FormatStyle: file
